    "hasAgenda": true,
    "summary": "The Citizens Weed Advisory Board meets October 29 in Norwood for a routine session covering administrative ground: approving August 2026 minutes, setting three proposed 2027 meeting dates (March 25, August 26, October 28), and working through several standing administrative questions — whether Vegetation Control & Management has the authority to handle enforcement, how grant funds are shaping up for 2027, the status of America the Beautiful funds, and who has actually signed the board's Code of Conduct. The included meeting minutes from 2025 show the operational backdrop: 419 acres treated last year, ongoing Tamarisk biocontrol monitoring in Disappointment Valley with uncertain beetle results, and a persistent gap in board membership and enforcement capacity under Senate Bill 2431.",
